11.1 FINANCIAL CALCULATIONS

Project revenue:
The agreed project price.

Cash collected:
The total of recorded client payments.

Outstanding client balance:
Agreed project price minus valid client payments, subject to applicable refunds and adjustments.

Developer cost:
The agreed developer cost.

Developer payments:
The total of recorded developer payments.

Outstanding developer balance:
Agreed developer cost minus valid developer payments.

Estimated project profit:
Agreed project price minus developer cost, other project expenses, and applicable commission.

